1
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:32,759
What is it?

2
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,319
Regarding what happened before,

3
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,960
I really was in the wrong.

4
00:02:47,719 --> 00:02:49,319
I'm here today to apologize.

5
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,360
I'm sorry.

6
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,120
But this incident has also

7
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:57,439
exposed flaws in the company's management.

8
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,120
So I've put together a proposal.

9
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,879
Please take a look, President An.

10
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:06,000
I think we can use this opportunity

11
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:07,039
to implement reforms.

12
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:08,560
Weed out the underperformers,

13
00:03:08,879 --> 00:03:10,759
adopt agricultural support measures,

14
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:13,599
and help qualifying fruit farmers.

15
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,199
You did well.

16
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,960
I'll leave this to you.

17
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:31,120
But

18
00:03:34,479 --> 00:03:36,080
remember what you said today.

19
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:41,479
You can hold me to it, Little Uncle.

20
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:51,960
Auntie Hong!

21
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,360
Auntie Hong!

22
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:57,919
Bring me a cup of coffee.

23
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:01,800
Baby.

24
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,039
I want this one.

25
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,400
Okay.

26
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,599
Let me feed you.

27
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:06,479
Here.

28
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,000
I want some too.

29
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:15,879
Here.

30
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:16,839
I'll feed you.

31
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,360
Mom!

32
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,480
What are you doing?

33
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,000
He... he...

34
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,600
Who... who is he?

35
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,240
What's the matter?

36
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,399
Stop making such a fuss.

37
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:44,000
He's your elder.

38
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:50,759
Wait.

39
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:51,399
Mom,

40
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,879
do you hear yourself?

41
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:54,759
What did you just say?

42
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:57,279
This little bastard is my elder?

43
00:04:58,879 --> 00:05:00,000
Cheng Yan, don't worry.

44
00:05:00,519 --> 00:05:03,000
I'll treat you like my own son.

45
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:03,639
Me?

46
00:05:09,199 --> 00:05:10,959
You're wearing my clothes,

47
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,079
drinking my supplements,

48
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:12,800
and...

49
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:14,240
hugging my mom?

50
00:05:17,279 --> 00:05:19,839
You... get your hands off my mom.

51
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,240
Take them off!

52
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:25,680
Or I'll mess you up right now!

53
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:26,399
Honey,

54
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,600
look at him.

55
00:05:27,639 --> 00:05:28,439
Cheng Yan!

56
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,480
That's enough!

57
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,759
Apologize to your uncle right now.

58
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:31,560
Me?

59
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,600
I...

60
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:35,600
Apologize to him?

61
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,600
What the hell is he?

62
00:05:37,959 --> 00:05:39,120
I should apologize to him?

63
00:05:42,399 --> 00:05:42,800
No...

64
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:43,199
It's...

65
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,240
It's like this.

66
00:05:44,839 --> 00:05:46,680
Get him out of this house right now.

67
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:49,000
It's either him or me in this house!

68
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Him or me!

69
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:50,600
Out! Out! Out!

70
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,319
Fine.

71
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,439
Then if you won't apologize,

72
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,800
you can leave this house.

73
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,399
Have some more.

74
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,240
Drink up!

75
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,319
It'll make you strong.

76
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,160
I'll drink some too.

77
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,600
So good!

78
00:06:22,759 --> 00:06:23,920
Can you handle it?

79
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,519
Who's taking a cab with me?

80
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,399
I'll take her! I'll take her!

81
00:06:31,399 --> 00:06:32,560
It's fine! Drink!

82
00:06:34,279 --> 00:06:35,439
Stop talking.

83
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:37,480
Let's go, let's go. Time to go home.

84
00:06:38,519 --> 00:06:39,879
Your car is over there.

85
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:53,319
Little niece.

86
00:06:55,439 --> 00:06:56,800
What's your grandma doing?

87
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,519
Has she been looking for me?

88
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,800
Nope.

89
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,560
Grandma is preparing for

90
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,680
her boyfriend's birthday.

91
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,120
What are you doing?

92
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:12,319
Happy birthday to you,

93
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:15,879
Happy birthday to you,

94
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:19,399
Happy birthday to you,

95
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:23,160
Happy birthday to you!

96
00:07:23,879 --> 00:07:24,680
Honey.

97
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:25,800
Make a wish.

98
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:27,399
I hope

99
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:30,000
I can be with you forever, honey.

100
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,360
Never apart for the rest of our lives.

101
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,720
Let me wish you a happy birthday!

102
00:07:36,279 --> 00:07:37,079
Go to hell!

103
00:07:37,079 --> 00:07:38,120
Go join the dead!

104
00:07:42,639 --> 00:07:43,480
Honey!

105
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:47,879
Cheng Yan!

106
00:07:47,879 --> 00:07:49,800
Are you hoping I die early?

107
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:50,439
Mom.

108
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:52,759
Will you get your head straight?

109
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,680
If you want to have fun,

110
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,879
I'll find you a place.

111
00:07:54,879 --> 00:07:55,680
I'll find you Russians,

112
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,920
or Westerners.

113
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,800
He's just a gold-digging toy boy!

114
00:07:58,879 --> 00:08:00,240
He just wants your money!

115
00:08:00,439 --> 00:08:01,240
Second Uncle.

116
00:08:01,399 --> 00:08:02,519
Calm down.

117
00:08:02,639 --> 00:08:04,519
Grandma might have her reasons.

118
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,920
Your grandma isn't thinking straight.

119
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,279
Are you not thinking straight either?

120
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:08,920
Are none of you thinking straight?

121
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:09,639
Honey.

122
00:08:09,639 --> 00:08:10,519
Don't be mad.

123
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,920
I want to be with you forever.

124
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,399
Live together,

125
00:08:12,399 --> 00:08:13,279
die together.

126
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:15,160
Die together?

127
00:08:16,279 --> 00:08:17,079
Cheng Yan!

128
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,560
You unfilial son!

129
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,040
You just want to anger me to death!

130
00:08:20,759 --> 00:08:21,560
Honey,

131
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,759
I believe you.

132
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,360
Mom.

133
00:08:24,439 --> 00:08:25,199
Mom.

134
00:08:25,199 --> 00:08:26,600
I'm your own son.

135
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:28,240
I'm your own flesh and blood!

136
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:28,959
You don't believe me,

137
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:29,920
but you believe him?

138
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,319
At your age,

139
00:08:31,319 --> 00:08:32,440
do you still believe that in this world

140
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,879
there are such good men?

141
00:08:33,879 --> 00:08:35,480
He's just scheming for your money!

142
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,159
I think

143
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,879
the one scheming for my money is you!

144
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:40,799
Cheng Yan,

145
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:41,919
let me tell you,

146
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:43,159
if you keep this up,

147
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,200
you won't get a single penny!

148
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:50,919
Mom,

149
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:52,679
Mom.

150
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:55,399
I... I didn't mean that.

151
00:08:55,679 --> 00:08:56,480
I mean,

152
00:08:57,399 --> 00:08:59,080
I'm your own son.

153
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:01,480
I'll be the one to provide until the end.

154
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,759
Otherwise, will you rely on him?

155
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,919
If you don't break up with this toy boy,

156
00:09:06,399 --> 00:09:08,039
then don't consider me your son anymore!

157
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,000
Perfect.

158
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,039
I'll just act as if

159
00:09:14,039 --> 00:09:15,480
I never had this son.

160
00:09:16,039 --> 00:09:16,840
Today,

161
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,559
I have something to announce to everyone.

162
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:19,559
I am

163
00:09:21,159 --> 00:09:22,080
pregnant.

164
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,840
I'm going to be a dad!

165
00:09:38,879 --> 00:09:39,679
Madam

166
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:54,000
Your grandma is pregnant.

167
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,759
Aren't you worried at all?

168
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,639
Grandma is older now.

169
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,720
Pregnancy naturally carries risks.

170
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,639
Sang Luo,

171
00:10:02,159 --> 00:10:03,919
there's no need to pretend with me.

172
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:06,440
Your grandma is having a little son,

173
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,320
so she won't have time

174
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,720
to care about you, her granddaughter.

175
00:10:09,399 --> 00:10:10,320
Auntie Lin,

176
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:11,759
do you know what the biggest difference

177
00:10:11,759 --> 00:10:13,399
between the two of us is?

178
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:17,000
It's that I never covet others' things.

179
00:10:25,399 --> 00:10:26,200
Shen Zhou,

180
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,720
I'm really sorry.

181
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:31,200
I never expected things to go this way.

182
00:10:31,799 --> 00:10:33,320
Actually, this was just an accident.

183
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,480
If you hadn't sought me out,

184
00:10:35,799 --> 00:10:37,080
the life I've lived recently,

185
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,799
I might never have experienced it.

186
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,720
But this child...

187
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:47,000
Since this child is coming into the world,

188
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,080
it means we are meant to be.

189
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,879
I gladly accept it.

190
00:10:54,639 --> 00:10:56,480
You're much braver than I imagined.

191
00:10:59,679 --> 00:11:00,480
Sang Luo,

192
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,200
actually, I should thank you.

193
00:11:02,559 --> 00:11:03,879
If it weren't for you donating

194
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,559
bone marrow to my sister,

195
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:08,559
I'd have lost my only relative.

196
00:11:09,679 --> 00:11:10,879
I owe you a life.

197
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,480
In this world,

198
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:14,840
every single life

199
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,600
deserves to be treated well.

200
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,759
From today onwards,

201
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:22,120
I'll shoulder my duties as a father.

202
00:11:24,679 --> 00:11:25,480
Understood.

203
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:30,080
So I've always wanted to ask you,

204
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:34,320
are you serious about Old Mrs. Cheng?

205
00:11:38,519 --> 00:11:39,960
We are not made of stone.

206
00:11:41,279 --> 00:11:42,480
How can we not have feelings?

207
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,399
Right?

208
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:20,759
Sister-in-law.

209
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:22,840
You're in quite the mood today,

210
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,480
asking to meet me alone.

211
00:12:37,399 --> 00:12:39,799
No wonder a toy boy suddenly popped up.

212
00:12:41,639 --> 00:12:43,159
It was all that damn girl's doing.

213
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,679
It was your dear niece,

214
00:12:44,679 --> 00:12:45,480
Sang Luo.

215
00:12:46,039 --> 00:12:47,399
And that's not all.

216
00:12:47,639 --> 00:12:50,039
Who do you think leaked your scandal?

217
00:12:50,519 --> 00:12:51,639
This niece of yours...

218
00:12:51,639 --> 00:12:54,080
...has done a lot behind your back.

219
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,360
How do you know?

220
00:12:58,399 --> 00:12:59,799
If she really did all this...

221
00:12:59,799 --> 00:13:00,840
I won't let her get away with it.

222
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:02,720
I'll ask her myself.

223
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,559
Do you have any proof?

224
00:13:03,559 --> 00:13:04,360
You're just going to go?

225
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:04,639
I...

226
00:13:04,639 --> 00:13:05,840
You're so impulsive.

227
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:08,080
No wonder you ended up in this state.

228
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,799
If you have an idea, just say it.

229
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:14,200
Spare me the smart talk.

230
00:13:29,279 --> 00:13:30,679
Brilliant move, sister-in-law.

231
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:40,240
Did you see the photos on social media?

232
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:42,080
Old Mrs. Cheng and that man...

233
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:43,759
That man looks a few years younger...

234
00:13:43,759 --> 00:13:45,279
...than Director Sang.

235
00:13:45,279 --> 00:13:46,000
Right?

236
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,159
He's really good-looking.

237
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:48,080
Rich people, huh.

238
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,360
Who knows if it's true or not.

239
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:51,360
Looks like their relationship isn't simple.

240
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:53,600
What are you looking at?

241
00:13:54,759 --> 00:13:56,679
We were just talking about our weekend plans.

242
00:13:57,039 --> 00:13:57,559
Yeah, yeah.

243
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:07,200
Director Sang.

244
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,240
Did you see what's on the internet?

245
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:11,720
What is it?

246
00:14:16,399 --> 00:14:18,600
It's already gone viral across all platforms.

247
00:14:22,279 --> 00:14:23,559
When was it posted?

248
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:24,600
Just now.

249
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,080
Notify the PR department.

250
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,519
In 10 minutes,

251
00:14:28,519 --> 00:14:29,559
meeting in the conference room.

252
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:39,159
Speak up, everyone.

253
00:14:39,399 --> 00:14:40,919
Who leaked this?

254
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:43,320
Right now,

255
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:45,960
I have the right to suspect each of you.

256
00:14:48,399 --> 00:14:49,200
Including you,

257
00:14:51,039 --> 00:14:51,840
A Xi.

258
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:53,559
I swear to you,

259
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,200
I have never...

260
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:56,440
...done anything to betray you.

261
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,039
Just shut your mouth.

262
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,320
Those vows of yours...

263
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:00,879
...I could make 800 times a day.

264
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:03,240
Mom,

265
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,080
right now, the Cheng family's reputation...

266
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,639
...is ruined nationwide.

267
00:15:07,519 --> 00:15:09,279
Our Cheng family is getting famous...

268
00:15:09,399 --> 00:15:10,600
...not for our red wine,

269
00:15:11,399 --> 00:15:13,279
...but because of your new romance.

270
00:15:13,919 --> 00:15:15,120
And who introduced...

271
00:15:16,799 --> 00:15:17,879
...this new romance to you?

272
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:20,799
Sang Luo.

273
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,600
Come clean.

274
00:15:24,159 --> 00:15:25,000
Stop pretending.

275
00:15:25,919 --> 00:15:27,039
Come clean about what?

276
00:15:28,759 --> 00:15:30,840
Coach Shen and I go way back.

277
00:15:30,919 --> 00:15:32,080
Introducing him to Grandma...

278
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:33,600
...was just to be her coach.

279
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,440
Meeting in private...

280
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:36,480
...was to ask about Grandma's preferences.

281
00:15:36,919 --> 00:15:38,440
I'm a victim in this photo too!

282
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:39,200
Second Uncle,

283
00:15:39,399 --> 00:15:41,440
what do you mean, 'daily preferences'?

284
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:44,639
The photo makes it perfectly clear.

285
00:15:44,759 --> 00:15:46,440
Grandma and granddaughter after one man!

286
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,879
What can one photo prove,

287
00:15:48,879 --> 00:15:49,639
Second Uncle?

288
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:51,799
What can it prove?

289
00:15:51,799 --> 00:15:52,840
You can't even explain this clearly.

290
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:54,159
What do you think it proves?

291
00:15:54,639 --> 00:15:55,440
Explain yourself.

292
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,799
What was your real purpose in contacting him?

293
00:15:58,039 --> 00:15:59,840
Are you after my mom's fortune?

294
00:16:00,039 --> 00:16:02,120
Condemning Sang Luo over a single photo...

295
00:16:03,559 --> 00:16:04,600
...is too hasty.

296
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:06,200
I've already sent someone...

297
00:16:06,559 --> 00:16:07,960
...to delete the post.

298
00:16:08,639 --> 00:16:09,919
This kind of rich family gossip...

299
00:16:09,919 --> 00:16:11,919
...is just for everyone's entertainment.

300
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:14,679
It won't cause any actual harm.

301
00:16:19,799 --> 00:16:20,600
Sang Luo,

302
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,720
it's not that we don't believe you.

303
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,039
It's mainly because...

304
00:16:24,039 --> 00:16:25,759
...you're new to the Cheng family.

305
00:16:26,279 --> 00:16:27,679
Even if Coach Shen...

306
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:29,759
...wanted to know your grandma's habits...

307
00:16:29,799 --> 00:16:30,919
...to take care of her...

308
00:16:30,919 --> 00:16:32,440
...daily life after pregnancy,

309
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,559
asking anyone of us sitting here...

310
00:16:34,759 --> 00:16:36,080
...would make more sense than asking you.

311
00:16:38,919 --> 00:16:40,600
I definitely couldn't go to you.

312
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:43,879
A Xi would get worried.

313
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,840
If I went to Cheng Yan,

314
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:49,360
he would beat you up.

315
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:56,039
Mom,

316
00:16:56,039 --> 00:16:58,200
there... there's a question I have.

317
00:16:59,399 --> 00:17:00,639
Ever since this woman named Sang Luo

318
00:17:00,639 --> 00:17:01,919
came to our Cheng family,

319
00:17:01,919 --> 00:17:03,080
look at how many things have happened.

320
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:04,720
My poor sister

321
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,799
is now in a nursing home.

322
00:17:07,559 --> 00:17:08,359
Sister-in-law

323
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,960
almost had a miscarriage.

324
00:17:12,079 --> 00:17:12,880
And then there's Dongdong.

325
00:17:13,359 --> 00:17:15,400
One minute he's falling into the pool,

326
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:17,240
the next he's falling down the stairs.

327
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,039
Every single one

328
00:17:18,039 --> 00:17:19,799
of these incidents, when did they happen?

329
00:17:20,119 --> 00:17:22,000
If you ask me, she's a Jinx.

330
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,039
Not only is she a Jinx,

331
00:17:23,039 --> 00:17:24,519
she also brought this thing in.

332
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,880
Kick them all out.

333
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:27,519
Give our Cheng family some peace and quiet.

334
00:17:33,039 --> 00:17:33,839
Sang Luo,

335
00:17:36,839 --> 00:17:38,599
since this child is coming into the world,

336
00:17:39,039 --> 00:17:40,319
it means we're meant to be.

337
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:42,480
I gladly accept it.

338
00:17:43,599 --> 00:17:44,640
From today onwards,

339
00:17:45,319 --> 00:17:47,799
I'll shoulder my duties as a father.

340
00:17:48,839 --> 00:17:49,640
All right.

341
00:17:49,799 --> 00:17:50,799
Then let me tell you

342
00:17:50,799 --> 00:17:53,079
about some of Grandma's daily habits.

343
00:17:53,079 --> 00:17:55,279
Grandma drinks bird's nest every night.

344
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,119
I'm sorry, darling.

345
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,000
I misunderstood you.

346
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,000
It's okay, A Xi.

347
00:18:01,519 --> 00:18:02,119
I told you,

348
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:05,039
I would never do anything to betray you.

349
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,160
We originally planned to use Shen Zhou

350
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,880
to make their lives miserable.

351
00:18:17,319 --> 00:18:18,000
I didn't expect

352
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,480
Cheng Yan and Lin Wanmei to outsmart us.

353
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:26,799
But if we look at it from another angle,

354
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:29,359
bringing these filthy schemes

355
00:18:29,359 --> 00:18:30,799
out into the open

356
00:18:31,119 --> 00:18:32,839
might not be a bad thing.

357
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:35,559
You're right.

358
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:41,160
You mean,

359
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,640
An old tree blossoming is good for us?

360
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,279
Yes.

361
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:54,960
Sang Luo,

362
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:56,599
when this is all over,

363
00:18:56,599 --> 00:18:57,920
come back to Korea with me.

364
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,440
Let's talk about it later, Yi Kai.

365
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,480
I haven't decided yet.

366
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,039
What's wrong?

367
00:19:15,799 --> 00:19:16,799
You can't bear to part with Cheng An?

368
00:19:22,039 --> 00:19:22,920
It's getting late.

369
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:24,920
I should head back now.

370
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:29,759
I'll walk you out.

371
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:53,720
This is far enough.

372
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:03,920
Oh, you.

373
00:20:04,559 --> 00:20:06,200
Bundle up, it's getting cold.

374
00:20:07,559 --> 00:20:08,440
Get some rest.

375
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,279
Look how exhausted you've been.

376
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:14,279
A Luo.

377
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:21,640
I really want

378
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,599
you to come back to Korea with me.

379
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,559
Think it over.

380
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:28,480
I'll think about it.

381
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:33,279
What are you doing?

382
00:21:11,119 --> 00:21:12,519
I'm your Little Uncle.

383
00:21:14,759 --> 00:21:15,640
Dating

384
00:21:17,079 --> 00:21:18,920
requires an elder's permission.

385
00:21:20,039 --> 00:21:21,359
Are you crazy?

386
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,319
Right, right, right.

387
00:22:23,599 --> 00:22:25,079
A little lighter.

388
00:22:25,279 --> 00:22:25,839
Okay.

389
00:22:25,839 --> 00:22:27,039
This is very comfortable.

390
00:22:27,519 --> 00:22:28,319
Empress Dowager

391
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:32,000
Mom,

392
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:34,079
I

393
00:22:34,079 --> 00:22:35,200
personally brought my brother's

394
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:36,920
test report over here.

395
00:22:37,599 --> 00:22:38,920
As if you'd be so kind.

396
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,759
I thought you disowned me as your mother.

397
00:22:41,559 --> 00:22:42,200
Mom,

398
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:44,480
I've thought it through, you know.

399
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:45,200
I figured,

400
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:47,559
as long as parents are happy,

401
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:49,559
isn't that their children's greatest joy?

402
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:51,960
Besides, I'll be a big brother soon.

403
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:54,559
I must take on a brother's duties.

404
00:22:55,920 --> 00:22:57,799
So what does the test report say?

405
00:22:58,920 --> 00:22:59,960
Let me read it to you.

406
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:01,880
This test report says

407
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:05,039
that the fetus has a

408
00:23:05,039 --> 00:23:08,200
relatively high risk of Down syndrome.

409
00:23:08,519 --> 00:23:09,319
It suggests...

410
00:23:09,759 --> 00:23:10,559
Oh my, Mom.

411
00:23:11,519 --> 00:23:13,440
Th-th-this Down syndrome,

412
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:15,200
doesn't that mean he'll be an idiot?

413
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:17,279
Look,

414
00:23:17,279 --> 00:23:18,799
I was prepared to be a big brother,

415
00:23:18,799 --> 00:23:19,400
but I wasn't prepared

416
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:21,079
to be a big brother to an idiot.

417
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:23,799
Darling.

418
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:26,079
You have such good genes,

419
00:23:26,359 --> 00:23:28,119
and had so many healthy children.

420
00:23:28,119 --> 00:23:28,640
This... this...

421
00:23:29,079 --> 00:23:31,319
How could you have an idiot?

422
00:23:31,359 --> 00:23:32,160
Not exactly.

423
00:23:32,359 --> 00:23:34,160
Our Cheng family's genes

424
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,519
are indeed quite excellent.

425
00:23:35,519 --> 00:23:36,960
But your genes...

426
00:23:38,319 --> 00:23:39,119
Besides,

427
00:23:39,119 --> 00:23:40,200
for older mothers,

428
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:42,599
the risk of giving birth is already

429
00:23:42,599 --> 00:23:43,480
extremely high.

430
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:44,559
Hundreds of times higher.

431
00:23:44,559 --> 00:23:45,559
Shut your mouth.

432
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:47,440
I'll shut up, I'll shut up.

433
00:23:50,039 --> 00:23:50,839
Mom,

434
00:23:51,599 --> 00:23:53,079
let me state my stance first.

435
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:55,160
Our Cheng family has a vast fortune.

436
00:23:55,160 --> 00:23:56,799
Raising an idiot is no problem.

437
00:23:57,079 --> 00:23:59,480
As long as you're ready for the disgrace,

438
00:23:59,480 --> 00:24:01,759
I'll provide until the end for my brother.

439
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:02,799
What are you all talking about?

440
00:24:02,799 --> 00:24:03,759
It's so lively in here.

441
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:05,359
Luo Luo.

442
00:24:20,079 --> 00:24:20,720
It's fine.

443
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:21,440
Grandma,

444
00:24:21,599 --> 00:24:22,359
I heard that

445
00:24:22,359 --> 00:24:24,720
Down syndrome screening often has errors.

446
00:24:25,079 --> 00:24:27,000
Why don't I find a few more hospitals

447
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:28,000
and we get a second opinion?

448
00:24:28,559 --> 00:24:30,680
Why are you being so unreasonable?

449
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:32,599
Your grandma is advanced in age.

450
00:24:32,599 --> 00:24:34,200
Going to several hospitals for checkups...

451
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:35,160
Wouldn't that be exhausting for her?

452
00:24:35,160 --> 00:24:35,799
Besides,

453
00:24:35,799 --> 00:24:37,279
do you want the Cheng family

454
00:24:37,279 --> 00:24:39,000
to lose face before the whole world?

455
00:24:39,119 --> 00:24:40,240
Second Uncle is right.

456
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:41,920
I didn't think this through.

457
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:44,000
In that case,

458
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:46,720
let's just stay at this hospital

459
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:47,960
and do the test one more time.

460
00:24:48,599 --> 00:24:49,880
What do you mean, "one more time"?

461
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:51,359
I told you it's exhausting.

462
00:24:51,359 --> 00:24:53,279
How could a report I got myself be wrong?

463
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:54,799
Second Uncle,

464
00:24:55,079 --> 00:24:56,720
I just want to play it safe.

465
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:59,880
Hospitals making mistakes on test reports

466
00:25:00,119 --> 00:25:01,599
is actually quite common.

467
00:25:03,599 --> 00:25:04,400
Cheng Yan,

468
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:06,640
are you sure there's no problem

469
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:08,079
with this report?

470
00:25:11,119 --> 00:25:12,759
I picked it up myself.

471
00:25:12,759 --> 00:25:13,799
There's no way there's a problem.

472
00:25:18,119 --> 00:25:18,920
Grandma...

473
00:25:19,079 --> 00:25:19,880
What is it?

474
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:22,000
Look at this part with your name.

475
00:25:26,319 --> 00:25:27,440
Mom, Mom, Mom!

476
00:25:27,440 --> 00:25:29,680
I just thought giving birth is exhausting,

477
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:30,559
and dangerous.

478
00:25:30,559 --> 00:25:31,839
That's why I changed your name on it!

479
00:25:31,839 --> 00:25:32,960
Great. Just great.

480
00:25:33,079 --> 00:25:34,680
You even dared to deceive me.

481
00:25:36,960 --> 00:25:38,160
I... I'll get going now.

482
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:39,160
Get some rest!

483
00:25:39,559 --> 00:25:40,240
Alright, alright.

484
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:41,000
Darling,

485
00:25:41,319 --> 00:25:42,160
calm down.

486
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:43,359
Don't upset the baby.

487
00:25:43,759 --> 00:25:44,400
As long as the baby

488
00:25:44,400 --> 00:25:46,279
is healthy, that's all that matters.

489
00:25:46,319 --> 00:25:46,839
Right?

490
00:25:46,839 --> 00:25:47,559
He's just...

491
00:25:47,559 --> 00:25:48,440
just an...

492
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,680
idiot.

493
00:25:51,680 --> 00:25:52,519
Calm down.

494
00:25:53,079 --> 00:25:53,920
Calm down.

495
00:25:57,160 --> 00:25:57,960
Grandma,

496
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:03,960
here.

497
00:26:04,720 --> 00:26:06,039
I stewed some bird's nest for you.

498
00:26:07,440 --> 00:26:09,000
You're such a good child.

499
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:13,799
Try it.

500
00:26:17,519 --> 00:26:18,319
It's delicious.

501
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:22,640
Grandma misunderstood you.

502
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:23,400
Grandma,

503
00:26:23,839 --> 00:26:25,279
what are you talking about?

504
00:26:25,559 --> 00:26:27,880
Harmony is what matters most in a family.

505
00:26:30,799 --> 00:26:33,000
But I went back and thought about it.

506
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:36,319
Everyone argued so fiercely that day.

507
00:26:37,599 --> 00:26:39,519
Actually, setting aside the news for now,

508
00:26:39,519 --> 00:26:41,680
and who exactly exposed it.

509
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:43,240
With the current public opinion,

510
00:26:44,799 --> 00:26:47,240
people don't seem very accepting.

511
00:26:47,880 --> 00:26:50,559
Including the company's shareholders

512
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,079
and partners.

513
00:26:53,039 --> 00:26:53,960
Well...

514
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:57,559
What are you suggesting then?

515
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:01,640
Grandma, you've weathered many storms,

516
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:03,480
so you're not afraid of this gossip.

517
00:27:04,119 --> 00:27:06,000
But have you thought about this child?

518
00:27:07,079 --> 00:27:08,440
After he's born,

519
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:10,880
what will others think of him?

520
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:23,240
This child is a gift from heaven,

521
00:27:23,640 --> 00:27:26,160
and the fruit of your love with Coach Shen.

522
00:27:26,440 --> 00:27:27,920
Grandma, you definitely want him

523
00:27:27,920 --> 00:27:29,480
to grow up happy, right?

524
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:32,400
So, after much deliberation,

525
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,640
I've come up with an idea.
